WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.300
Just three months to the day after the killing&nbsp;
of Dillinger. Melvin Purvis and his gang of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:11.220
officers killed Pretty Boy Floyd in a running&nbsp;
gun battle near the small village of Wellsville,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.220 --> 00:00:15.960
Ohio. Here he had seen with his body&nbsp;
riddled with bullets shortly before it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:20.010
was sent home to his aged mother.&nbsp;
Thus sorrow fell again on another&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.010 --> 00:00:26.430
humble home. 1934 was a banner year for the&nbsp;
Department of Justice under the leadership&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.430 --> 00:00:32.340
of J. Edgar Hoover in Chicago Baby Face&nbsp;
Nelson was shot in a run in with G-Men

